• seek to discover and develop additional product candidates and further expand our clinical product pipeline;
• seek regulatory approvals for any product candidates that successfully complete clinical trials;
• continue to scale up internal and external manufacturing capacity with the aim of securing sufficient quantities to meet our capacity requirements for
clinical trials and potential commercialization;
• establish sales, marketing and distribution infrastructure to commercialize any product candidate for which we may obtain regulatory approval;
• make required milestone and royalty payments to UCL Business plc, or UCLB, the technology-transfer company of University College London, or
